      'Scoring example: Game points are scored for declaring trumps (2), non-trump marriages (1 each), last trick (1), and majority of card points (1; tie awards none). Card points: Ace 10 or 11, Ten 10, King 4 or 5, Queen 3 or 5, Jack 2 or 5, 9-6 zero (simplified or original system). First partnership to reach exactly 10 game points wins. Going over 10 reduces score to 7; taking no tricks in a hand reduces partnership score to 0..',
